Authorization: Bearer {{user_jwt_token}}

#### 3.3.3 Create Subject
POST {{base_url}}/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_jwt_token}}

{
    "data": {
        "name": ""
    }
}

#### 3.3.4 Update Subject
PUT {{base_url}}/api/subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_jwt_token}}

{
    "data": {
        "name": ""
    }
}

#### 3.3.5 Delete Subject
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/subjects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_jwt_token}}